{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Exo Exploits</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Operator of the Galactic Trade Federation (GTF), you are sent to distant planets to expand your corporate empire. Your mission is simple: build factories, exploit resources, and turn profits. But in a galaxy driven by greed,how far will you go to meet the Federation\u2019s demands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Expand Your Industrial Empire</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and manage a futuristic factory complex to maximize efficiency and profit. Balance resource extraction, production, and logistics as you grow your off-planet empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create and Command Space Fleets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft specialized spaceships for trade, research, and defense. Assemble fleets to secure lucrative trade routes, fend off competitors, and unlock new opportunities across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430520/extras/79aaeb78c29a7077309cdb820c4ed0da.poster.avif?t=1750348881\" width=800 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430520/extras/79aaeb78c29a7077309cdb820c4ed0da.webm?t=1750348881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430520/extras/79aaeb78c29a7077309cdb820c4ed0da.mp4?t=1750348881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Contracts and Influence the Federation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts from the GTF, ranging from resource gathering to fleet building. Every decision impacts your standing with the Federation\u2019s ruthless officials. Success brings rewards; failure has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a Neon-Fused, Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant, synthwave-inspired visuals of <i>Exo Exploits</i>. From glowing factory floors to pulsating space vistas, the retro-futuristic atmosphere makes every moment unforgettable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430520?t=1750348881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430520?t=1750348881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430520/f6ad64e455f77b42f3d33d80e4bf5034326c3f9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750348881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430520/f6ad64e455f77b42f3d33d80e4bf5034326c3f9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750348881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Exo Exploits</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Operator of the Galactic Trade Federation (GTF), you are sent to distant planets to expand your corporate empire. Your mission is simple: build factories, exploit resources, and turn profits. But in a galaxy driven by greed,how far will you go to meet the Federation\u2019s demands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Expand Your Industrial Empire</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and manage a futuristic factory complex to maximize efficiency and profit. Balance resource 